@startuml
autonumber
actor "Менеджер" as RestStaff
participant "Restaurant" as Mock
participant "Kitchen API" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== 1. Управление стоп-листом ==
RestStaff -> Mock: Закончились ингредиенты для блюда {item_id}
Mock -> API: PUT /api/v1/partner/restaurants/{id}/menu/{item_id}/availability\n{is_available: false}
API -> DB: UPDATE menu_items SET is_available = false
DB --> API: Updated
API --> Mock: 200 OK

== 2. Прием и обработка заказа ==
API -> Mock: POST /webhook/orders (Новый заказ: order_id, состав)
Mock --> API: 200 OK

Mock -> API: PATCH /api/v1/partner/orders/{order_id}/status\n{status: "COOKING"}
API -> DB: UPDATE orders SET status = 'COOKING'
DB --> API: Updated
API --> Mock: 200 OK

note over Mock: Процесс приготовления

Mock -> API: PATCH /api/v1/partner/orders/{order_id}/status\n{status: "READY"}
API -> DB: UPDATE orders SET status = 'READY'
DB --> API: Updated
API --> Mock: 200 OK
@enduml